# Query 3: KPI extraction - structured metrics
# Highlights: KPI agent + structured JSON-style output

Output recordings/03_kpi_ericsson.mp4

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "cd /home/axel-oeberg/pvk/quantera && source venv/bin/activate && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type `make query Q="Extract all key financial metrics for Ericsson in Q1 2025"`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 20s
